From: ax9000-build <build@ax9000.invalid>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:57:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] kernel: backport emc2305 OF support and fixes to 6.12

Backport the upstream hwmon emc2305 device-tree support (v6.15..v6.17):
binding, OF matching, devm_thermal_of_cooling_device_register, PWM
frequency/polarity/output config via DT child nodes, plus the later
fixes (v6.19..v7.2): double put, refcount leak, scoped child loop
(prerequisite of the index fix), resource leak, fan channel index.
0429415a084a (v6.17, initial PWM minimum) is already in 6.12.112.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
